    'Logic' => 'Logik',
    'Logic for a quiz or quote calculator. Options of radio, select and checkboxes fields may carry an amount ("Label | 1200"), a number field a unit_price, an estimate field adds them up to a total with an optional range (range_below/range_above in percent), rounding (round_to) and a minimum. "logic" holds rules and result variants: {"rules":[{"label":"…","match":"all|any","when":[{"field":"<field key>","op":"is|is_not|contains|not_contains|gt|lt|between|weekday|month|empty|not_empty","value":"…","to":"… (between)"}],"then":[{"do":"add|quantity|multiply|skip|show_when|result", …}]}],"results":[{"key":"…","heading":"…","text":"…","show_amount":true,"button_text":"","button_link":""}]} – add: {"do":"add","amount":100}, quantity (amount × the number in a field): {"do":"quantity","field":"<key>","amount":10}, multiply: {"do":"multiply","by":1.3}, skip: {"do":"skip","field":"<key>"} (the field is hidden when the rule holds), show_when: {"do":"show_when","field":"<key>"} (the field shows only when the rule holds), result: {"do":"result","variant":"<result key>"}. Fields are named by their key (get_build shows it), never by label. calculation "after_contact" shows the estimate only after the visitor sent their contact details (no amount is then in the page). Run it with try_form.' => 'Logik für ein Quiz oder einen Angebotsrechner. Optionen von Radio-, Auswahl- und Checkbox-Feldern können einen Betrag tragen ("Label | 1200"), ein Zahlenfeld einen unit_price, ein Schätzungsfeld addiert sie zu einer Summe mit optionaler Spanne (range_below/range_above in Prozent), Rundung (round_to) und Mindestbetrag. "logic" enthält Regeln und Ergebnisvarianten: {"rules":[{"label":"…","match":"all|any","when":[{"field":"<field key>","op":"is|is_not|contains|not_contains|gt|lt|between|weekday|month|empty|not_empty","value":"…","to":"… (between)"}],"then":[{"do":"add|quantity|multiply|skip|show_when|result", …}]}],"results":[{"key":"…","heading":"…","text":"…","show_amount":true,"button_text":"","button_link":""}]} – add: {"do":"add","amount":100}, quantity (Betrag × die Zahl in einem Feld): {"do":"quantity","field":"<key>","amount":10}, multiply: {"do":"multiply","by":1.3}, skip: {"do":"skip","field":"<key>"} (das Feld wird ausgeblendet, wenn die Regel zutrifft), show_when: {"do":"show_when","field":"<key>"} (das Feld erscheint nur, wenn die Regel zutrifft), result: {"do":"result","variant":"<result key>"}. Felder werden mit ihrem key benannt (get_build zeigt ihn), nie mit dem Label. calculation "after_contact" zeigt die Schätzung erst, nachdem der Besucher seine Kontaktdaten gesendet hat (dann steht kein Betrag in der Seite). Mit try_form ausführen.',
